<h1>Research</h1>

<p class="page-intro">
Buildings remain accountable for 37% of the global carbon emissions, 
reducing their carbon footprints is essential for the 2050 net zero target.
How can trustworthy human-AI decision systems accelerate decarbonisation in the built environment?
I combine advanced AI (agentic AI and RAG), construction domain knowledge (digital twins and BIM), management theories, and decision science
to support sustainable decision-making in buildings and cities.
</p>

