        <h3> GREAT (Green Retrofit Evidence-grounded Agent Team): Benchmarking Multi-agent RAG System for Green Retrofit Planning</h3>

        <p>
        This study develops a multi-agent RAG system, GREAT, to support green retrofitting planning in buildings.
        While many LLMs, such as GPT-5.6, Claude Fable 5, and Gemini 3.5, offers high-speed, long-horizong, and "Mythos" class capability,
        their outputs remain fundamentally ungrounded and susceptible to hallucinations. 
        
        We test how multi-agent RAG system can improve answer accuracy and usability by leveraging 
        construction domain knowledge and evidence-grounded reasoning to enhance the reliability and trustworthiness of AI-generated outputs.
        </p>

