        <h3>Convergence of Digital Twin and Human-Data Interaction: Advancing Customer Experience in the Built Environment</h3>

        <p>
        This paper is the first to explore the potential of a Digital Twin System, transitioning technologies
        from a product-centric Industry 4.0 to a human-centric Industry 5.0 era.

        Previous studies investigated DT applications in aviation, manufacturing and construction industries to improve accuracy and efficiency.
        While these findings showcased Digital Twin’s benefits as a product or process, they lack connection with humans.
        
        Our 3-tiered framework with 26 user cases demonstrates
        how Digital Twin System can be designed to enhance human-data interaction in the built environment.
        </p>

